{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Pre-close audit, recorded so the close is not where these are discovered.\n\n**`file_impact` was wrong and has been corrected.** It declared 2 paths; the merged commit for change 2986 touches 8. It now declares the real 8.\n\n**All 9 acceptance criteria are still unchecked.** A read-only agent is gathering evidence for each, including a full `make verify`. Boxes will be ticked only where the evidence genuinely supports them.\n\n**Sequencing that a successor must not get wrong.** Widening `file_impact` invalidated the plan attestation, so a fresh plan review is required before this can close. Do **not** start that review until the criteria boxes are ticked: ticking them edits the description, which is material the review pins, so reviewing first invalidates the review and costs a second full pass. Correct order is evidence, then boxes, then `review_plan_start`, then the close against `c4c0702878`."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789777973314164610,"uuid":"b54bea0b-22cc-4cbe-aab9-50d021e5975c"}